sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Caller
  participant S as Session
  participant M as MutationCoordinator
  participant V as Validator
  participant N as CapabilityNegotiator
  participant R as ResourceManager
  participant P as PluginRegistry
  participant T as RuntimeTopology
  participant D as DataPlane

  C->>S: Apply patch
  S->>M: Submit operation
  M->>T: Read current Vn
  M->>V: Validate candidate spec
  V-->>M: Valid
  M->>N: Negotiate changed edges
  N-->>M: Connection contracts
  M->>R: Reserve resources
  R-->>M: Resource lease
  M->>P: Create and open new nodes
  P-->>M: Warmed node runtimes
  M->>S: CAS publish Vn plus 1
  S-->>D: New packets use Vn plus 1
  M->>M: Drain or fast retire Vn
  M->>R: Release retired leases
  M-->>C: Operation succeeded
